Follow **AGENTS.md** at the repo root. It's the single source of truth (ownership, commands, standards, Definition of Done, Notion status updates).

Cursor-specific scope and habits:
- You may write only: `src/app/**` (NOT `src/app/api/**`), `src/components/**`, `src/lib/**`, `src/styles/**`, `public/**`, plus docs-only PRs.
- Never edit `src/server/**`, `src/shared/**`, `src/app/api/**`, `tests/e2e/**`, `eval/**`. If you need a change there, describe it in the hand-off message.
- Types come from `@/shared/contracts` (zod-inferred). Until an API exists, use fixtures in `src/lib/fixtures/*.json` that match MANUAL §8/§9.2 shapes.
- UI kit: shadcn/ui + Tailwind only. Server Components by default; `'use client'` only where needed.
- Add `data-testid` on interactive elements (`data-testid="submit-evidence"`, `"accept-proposal"`, `"paypal-buttons"`, `"verdict-<criterionId>"`, `"timeline-event"`).
- Money display: always via `formatMoney()` in `src/lib/format.ts`. Never do float maths in components.
- Before finishing: `npm run check`, attach a screenshot to the PR, and print the AGENTS.md §10 hand-off block.
